```js
const key = getKey();
const res = await fetch("/api/creator/export", { method: "POST", headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json", "x-creator-key": key?.creator_key }, body: JSON.stringify({ product_id: product }) });
if (!res.ok) { const err = await res.json().catch(() => ({})); alert(...); return; }
const html = await res.text();
```

Also the `downloadKit` uses api() which returns JSON — kit endpoint returns JSON {ok, kit} — fine.

Also creator.js redeemView top-up flow for NEW creators: redeemKit creates account with credits. TopUp for existing. Both exist.

